{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Legendary Feat\n\nPrerequisites: Intelligence 20 or higher, The ability to cast a 5th level necromancy spell\n\nYou have mastered the art of animating and controlling undead, gaining the following benefits:\n\n- When you cast a spell that creates or asserts your control over undead, such as Animate Dead, you can create or assert control over one additional undead.\n\n- When you cast a spell that creates or asserts your control over undead, such as Animate Dead, undead creatures with an Intelligence score lower than 10 created or controlled with spells slots of 6th-level or higher are permanently under your control until destroyed, or until you are reduced to 0 hit points, in which case you need to reassure their control with a number of spells slots decided by your GM, or loose your grip on them after 24 hours as normal. The last part doesn\u0027t applies if the spell says otherwise.\n\nThis benefit doesn\u0027t applies to spells that summon undead, such as Summon Undead.\n\n- You can learn two additional spells of 1st level or higher from the necromancy school, if it is available to a spellcasting class in which you have at least one level, and it is of a level at which you can cast spells. You can change the chosen spells whenever you gain a new level.","level":1}],"id":"Custom0aaff654-2c4c-465c-bccf-66fa5fe65e23","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Arch Necromancer [SM] [LG]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}